          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Automatisch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatically (uses more energy)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Automatisch (braucht mehr Energie)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatically: conversations from the Claude app" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Automatisch: Unterhaltungen aus der Claude-App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Away from your Wi-Fi, the iPhone reaches this Mac through a VPN such as Tailscale. With it on both devices, the app finds the Mac by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Außerhalb deines WLANs erreicht das iPhone diesen Mac über ein VPN wie Tailscale. Ist es auf beiden Geräten an, findet die App den Mac von selbst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Background helper" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hintergrunddienst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery below 10 percent: the Mac may sleep now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Akku unter 10 Prozent: Der Mac darf jetzt schlafen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitwarden" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitwarden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitwarden asks: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitwarden fragt: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitwarden CLI" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitwarden CLI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitwarden CLI %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitwarden CLI %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitwarden didn't answer in time. Check the internet connection and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitwarden hat nicht rechtzeitig geantwortet. Prüfe die Internetverbindung und versuche es noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitwarden didn't answer. Fill in from another password app, or ask your agent to try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitwarden hat nicht geantwortet. Füll die Felder aus einer anderen Passwort-App aus oder bitte deinen Agent, es noch einmal zu versuchen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitwarden doesn't have this login (any more)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Anmeldung gibt es in Bitwarden nicht (mehr)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitwarden emailed you a code. Enter it here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitwarden hat dir einen Code per E-Mail geschickt. Gib ihn hier ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitwarden is locked" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitwarden ist gesperrt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitwarden is locked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitwarden ist gesperrt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitwarden sent a verification code to %@. It asks for it because %@ signs in from a new device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitwarden hat einen Bestätigungscode an %1$@ geschickt. Es fragt danach, weil sich %2$@ von einem neuen Gerät aus anmeldet."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Bitwarden sent a verification code to %1$@. It asks for it because %2$@ signs in from a new device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bitwarden's command line tool answered unexpectedly (%@)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Befehlszeilenprogramm von Bitwarden hat unerwartet geantwortet (%@)."
